                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "790501606",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "If we have some extra time on our hands, we can explore the cave and find the rest of the diary fragments!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "790501607",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Speaking of which, the style of this painting is pretty unique... Even though it's not that fancy, it's still beautiful!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "790501608",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "And what's more important is that Paimon can understand it! Perhaps if Paimon imitates the style, she can also paint lovely yet understandable paintings!",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "790501609",
                                            "text": "Sensational paintings aren't necessarily complicated.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "790501611",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Yes! And if it's okay with you, let's take a picture of this painting!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "790501612",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Then Paimon can study the painting whenever she likes!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "790501614",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Maybe once Paimon has also painted something that pretty, it'll attract lots of Water Droplets that want to be Paimon's friends!"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "790501610",
                                            "text": "Wanna learn how to paint that way, Paimon?"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "790501604",
                            "text": "There are still many stories about the painter and Water Droplets we don't know."
